        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add Safari note for unprefixed CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">line-clamp</code> in Safari 18.2, mentioning that it was an accidental exposure.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3053903069\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26771\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26771/hovercard?comment_id=3046159494&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26771#issuecomment-3046159494\">#26771 (comment)</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28870",
            "title": "Add Safari note for unprefixed CSS `line-clamp` in Safari 18.2",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-20T22:22:21.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-20T14:43:24.000Z",
            "author": {
