        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates the <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGTransform.matrix</code> feature to point to the SVG 1.1 spec.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Browsers did not implement the change introduced in SVG 2, which expects the property to return <code class=\"notranslate\">DOMMatrix</code> instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGMatrix</code>, so the SVG 1.1 spec describes the de facto standard.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #28757.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3778005589\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28757\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28757/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28757\">#28757</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28865",
            "title": "Point SVGTransform.matrix to SVG 1.1 spec",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-20T22:21:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-20T11:11:56.000Z",
